    ],
    "summary": "Errata adding the [Corsairs and Travelling Players](vsdata:ability/drukhari.corsairs-and-travelling-players) army rule. With a **DRUKHARI** Army Faction, your army may contain **HARLEQUINS** and **ANHRATHE** units even without the **DRUKHARI** Faction keyword. Their combined points may total up to:\n\n- **Incursion**: 250 pts\n- **Strike Force**: 500 pts\n- **Onslaught**: 750 pts\n\nNone of these **HARLEQUINS** or **ANHRATHE** models can be your **WARLORD** or be given Enhancements.",
    "citations": [
      {
        "type": "app",
        "title": "Warhammer 40,000: The App",
